  "title": "Scrumptious Salisbury Steak in Mushroom Gravy",
  "description": "This hearty Salisbury steak in beef and mushroom gravy will remind you of Sunday dinners at grandma's house. Serve with mashed potatoes or buttered noodles.",
  "authors": [
    "BAGRUBA"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:47:56-04:00",
